	"Edge_Cuts.GBR" SUFFIX.

3)	SEE SEPARATE DRILL FILES WITH ".DRL" SUFFIX 
	FOR HOLE LOCATIONS.

4)	SURFACE FINISH: ENIG

5)	SOLDERMASK ON BOTH SIDES OF THE BOARD SHALL 
	BE LPI, COLOR GREEN.

6)	SILK SCREEN LEGEND TO BE APPLIED PER LAYER 
